      "reason": "`df -i` free inodes on the production filesystem. A temp dir on this machine says nothing about VM24's inode table, and a full inode table is an outage with plenty of free bytes. Needs VM24 read-only."
    },
    "metadata_scan_on_the_production_tree": {
      "label": "DEFERRED",
      "reason": "Scan cost is dominated by the filesystem's directory implementation and cache state at ~1.7M-6.6M files. Local timings do not extrapolate."
    },
    "open_fd_and_RSS_under_sustained_load": {
      "label": "DEFERRED",
      "reason": "H7's C=8/16 over 10 minutes is an S7 load-gate measurement against the real store; this harness runs no HTTP layer."
    },
    "peak_temp_disk_at_production_scale": {
      "label": "DEFERRED",
      "reason": "47/71/141 GB is arithmetic from 1.57 GB/day. Confirming it requires building one real block, which is a VM24 mutation."
    },
    "production_366d_point_latency": {
      "label": "DEFERRED",
      "reason": "\u00a710.4's 0.65 ms per extra segment call is a laptop-measured projection against a VM24 baseline of 76-100 ms. Measuring it at fixture extent would produce a number that looks like the gate and is not."
    }
  },
